OL,3,GNEWSARace fans urged to secure their
OL,4,Abikes on trip to island
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of road racing fans are
OL,7,Ftravelling to the Isle of Man over the
OL,8,Fnext week for the Classic TT and Manx
OL,9,FGrand Prix ` many making their way on
OL,10,Ftheir own motorcycles.
OL,12,FThose making the journey will be
OL,13,Ftravelling through ferry ports in
OL,14,FLancashire and Liverpool to board an
OL,15,FIsle of Man Steam Packet Company ferry.
OL,17,FRepresenting the culmination of the
OL,18,Froad racing season on the island, the
OL,19,Fevents run until 28 August, with racing
OL,20,Fset to begin on Saturday following a
OL,21,Fweek of qualifying sessions.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,447,445,260,140,0,100
